# Ogbomọ́ — Environment Variables
#
# DO NOT put your real API key in this file. This is a template only,
# safe to commit to GitHub. Copy the variable name below into Vercel's
# actual dashboard: Project Settings → Environment Variables.
#
# For local testing with `vercel dev`, copy this file to `.env.local`
# (which is already covered by the .gitignore below) and put your real
# key there instead — .env.local is never sent to GitHub.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-key-here-do-not-commit-the-real-one
